   "label": "堂本海斗",
   "x": 3296,
   "y": 68,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 371
  },
  {
   "id": "15b656be28fbb5d6",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "第一封信件",
   "x": 3960,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 308,
   "height": 108
  },
  {
   "id": "9590a700eb3a40e9",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "米迦勒",
   "x": 948,
   "y": 46,
   "width": 1660,
   "height": 417
  },
  {
   "id": "b503d9bb1f55ecce",
   "type": "group",
   "label": "封蠟",
   "x": 972,
   "y": 116,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 323
  },
  {
   "id": "fd053ae914d9d3a1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**信使受V修正力操控**\n\n信使有V的修正力殘留，由V操控",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 112,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "fa181d038705bddb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V有途徑獲得人魚機密",
   "x": 332,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "43ce113a999ecc9c",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "米迦勒被V操控",
   "x": 664,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "1843024885a34c25",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V是阿奎斯托",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 530,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "fc839a52f24a7eb5",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "堂本薰是倖存者之一",
   "x": 2656,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "8a3bbd0a65671b40",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**信使目標非復興海之住民**\n\n信使的行動目標不是復興海之住民，也不需要人魚公主的力量",
   "x": 664,
   "y": 112,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "9aea3b821b1ce370",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V與烏蘇拉是合作伙伴",
   "x": 2988,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "f86152a0b9309685",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V是彭達拉薩人",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 697,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "b06ab060c0d0b1fe",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "人魚方高層洩漏情報",
   "x": 332,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "ff80205b08f1d3fa",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**海上意外失憶被美嘉留所救**\n\n在海上遇到意外並失憶，被天城美嘉留所救，失去關於人魚的記憶",
   "x": 3320,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 148,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "eff8698369c9a2c4",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "遭到米迦勒襲擊",
   "x": 3320,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#EA580C"
  },
  {
   "id": "744e5912824cfd10",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**力量與水妖米迦勒同源**\n\n力量與水妖、米迦勒同源",
   "x": 3652,
   "y": 124,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 100,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "07f1f55c6e51bae3",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "合照",
   "x": 3984,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "8ceee7f56b26bcbb",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "企圖綁架人魚公主吸收力量",
   "x": 1660,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "03e97dfc8dbd88a0",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "米迦勒太快擺出對立態度",
   "x": 1826,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "affae4f70c0f236d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**積極合作對米迦勒應是最優解**\n\n積極尋求合作對米迦勒理應是最優解",
   "x": 1992,
   "y": 112,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "db9e53fce8c05ff1",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "**長老才是權力核心不應找公主談**\n\n長老才是權力核心，米迦勒不應找人魚公主談合作",
   "x": 2324,
   "y": 112,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 124,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "1a3a14b3bb32809b",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "米迦勒對人魚內部並不了解",
   "x": 2324,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  },
  {
   "id": "35f6847f6fe421cf",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "與彭達拉薩族徽相似",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "efaec783290e4f65",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "美國大眾牌子",
   "x": 1328,
   "y": 148,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#2563EB"
  },
  {
   "id": "9091e5ffa7d0c02d",
   "type": "text",
   "text": "V與彭達拉薩族有關",
   "x": 996,
   "y": 364,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 52,
   "color": "#7C3AED"
  }
 ],
